{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_45F5E709","title":"Mertie has Gossip","entry":"Dlg_45F5E709::entry","exit":"Dlg_45F5E709::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_A1632F96","articyId":"72057791606431418","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Alright, amigo?","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright, amigo?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":125.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21953","byteOffset":16192224,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_32D8F41F","articyId":"72057791606431432","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"This place has been hopping harder than a one-legged cricket! How the heck you convinced that sadsack Crogan to buy a bit of neon I got no idea!","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This place has been hopping harder than a one-legged cricket! How the heck you convinced that sadsack Crogan to buy a bit of neon I got no idea!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23142","byteOffset":16639776,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_D6BBE24D","articyId":"72057791606431438","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Not as many as Mertie mighta liked, but I sold a bit of neon, no sweat.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not as many as Mertie mighta liked, but I sold a bit of neon, no sweat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28515","byteOffset":18671472,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_718FFE2B","articyId":"72057791606431460","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Alright alright, you earned a spot of scuttlebutt. So whaddya wanna know about? Choose careful, buckerino.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright alright, you earned a spot of scuttlebutt. So whaddya wanna know about? Choose careful, buckerino.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47379","byteOffset":32260400,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_45223496","articyId":"72057791606431495","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"What's there to say? You got a debt you got a target on your head. Did hear something though...","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's there to say? You got a debt you got a target on your head. Did hear something though...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41786","byteOffset":30136360,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_EA1AB9C2","articyId":"72057791606431509","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Heard a whisper someone saw the Aseptic and lived to tell the tale.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Heard a whisper someone saw the Aseptic and lived to tell the tale.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24093","byteOffset":16994232,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_64C13118","articyId":"72057791606431523","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Some old hobo down in the Sewers. And don't ask me more than that cos I ain't saying. Talking about Aseptic gives me the heebs.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Some old hobo down in the Sewers. And don't ask me more than that cos I ain't saying. Talking about Aseptic gives me the heebs.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3034.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25740","byteOffset":17621832,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_E2FF9169","articyId":"72057791606431534","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Mucksters. They can do one into the sea. Though they ain't all alike. Take that Elias Malt, for instance...","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mucksters. They can do one into the sea. Though they ain't all alike. Take that Elias Malt, for instance...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43571","byteOffset":30812336,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_869AAEE2","articyId":"72057791606431548","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Nothing. I just heard he got a... flexible attitude, for a 'Sec hound. Do with that what you will.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing. I just heard he got a... flexible attitude, for a 'Sec hound. Do with that what you will.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32916","byteOffset":20337088,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_40C17DEB","articyId":"72057791606431555","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Word on the vine is that there's a new big cheese running the underground down there.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Word on the vine is that there's a new big cheese running the underground down there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18369","byteOffset":14837448,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_5E93D2B1","articyId":"72057791606431569","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"The Scorpion, folks are calling him. Real name I don't rightly know.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Scorpion, folks are calling him. Real name I don't rightly know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35506","byteOffset":25792680,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_04725F17","articyId":"72057791606431580","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Always was a slippery fish. Just when you thought you knew him, he'd show another face. Sometimes... nah.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Always was a slippery fish. Just when you thought you knew him, he'd show another face. Sometimes... nah.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34984","byteOffset":25594568,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_33D5453F","articyId":"72057791606431594","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Sometimes he'd let stuff slip. About other places he'd been. Reckon he came here from somewhere else.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sometimes he'd let stuff slip. About other places he'd been. Reckon he came here from somewhere else.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39281","byteOffset":29192160,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_6565402C","articyId":"72057791606431608","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"You're asking the wrong person, pumpkin! I've never left Meridian. I was born here and I'll die here and that's good enough for me.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're asking the wrong person, pumpkin! I've never left Meridian. I was born here and I'll die here and that's good enough for me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3034.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24783","byteOffset":17255768,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_5EDC127E","articyId":"72057791606431625","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Stop by and see me anytime, amigo.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Stop by and see me anytime, amigo.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3712.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27972","byteOffset":18462640,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_FEF9